  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Perform message delivery to NSQ with ease",
    "splashDescription": "NSQ is a real-time distributed messaging platform that promotes distributed and decentralized topologies without single points of failure. The NSQ outbound connector allows Camunda processes to publish messages to NSQ topics as part of a service task, enabling asynchronous communication and decoupling of processes. Developers can easily configure message content and NSQ topic details directly within BPMN process models.",
